{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659840/extras/891f99d4595423373c9e314b0ac59bd7.poster.avif?t=1763835733\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659840/extras/891f99d4595423373c9e314b0ac59bd7.webm?t=1763835733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Pilot A-RED, a charming wind-up robot, as you face the ingenious trials set by its creator in a fascinating workshop full of challenges, surprises, and enemies.<br><br>With the help of different physical mechanics and precise control, you must overcome multiple challenges: master balance skills, solve intricate mazes, move objects with your tiny hands, shoot lasers to move obstacles, defeat enemies, use electricity to activate switches, and even fly with your jetpack to cover great distances!<br><br>But nobody said it would be easy; A-RED\u2019s vital energy comes from its wind-up mechanism... Can you keep it always running?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659840/extras/b42087c2c49cd430571177e752c18354.poster.avif?t=1763835733\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659840/extras/b42087c2c49cd430571177e752c18354.webm?t=1763835733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> <br>Dare to pilot A-RED, walking on the ground or in the air with its jetpack, to discover all the surprises hidden in the gigantic and chaotic workshop!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659840/extras/558776841186bc52c764d37652ad40c0.poster.avif?t=1763835733\" width=620 height=349 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659840/extras/558776841186bc52c764d37652ad40c0.webm?t=1763835733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> <br>Push, remove, or shoot the objects and enemies in your way! Collect the golden wind-up keys scattered throughout the workshop to gain time and keep moving forward!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659840/extras/51e08418e959f0ac59809d80a5e6e512.poster.avif?t=1763835733\" width=620 height=349 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659840/extras/51e08418e959f0ac59809d80a5e6e512.webm?t=1763835733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> <br>Feel the emotions of our little friend A-RED flow through your circuits as the soundtrack created by Atsushi Moriya envelops you in an atmosphere of excitement and adventure.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659840/extras/c024f84389be81a4e540def2adf84ebd.poster.avif?t=1763835733\" width=620 height=349 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659840/extras/c024f84389be81a4e540def2adf84ebd.webm?t=1763835733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Escape Artist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2659840/6d7068b8e565a11a3e27e04f72bb0335cc25344f.jpg"},{"name":"Dino Lover","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2659840/9b7d6196b08d54b02f14a3b4fcb9818d65a9cd97.jpg"},{"name":"Alone in the Dark","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/pu